"seed": 2123265309, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1865589675, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173334, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Versi dokumen", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Versi dokumen", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1bbcdd9d41264173af85", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 502.1, "width": 526.6, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ff38523a67c4472f9532"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2135587073, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 928446889, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173334, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "document_versions: tiap edit/generate = versi baru.\nSumber: upload · generate_* · edit_document · apply_word_edits · replicate.\nTrigger DB membersihkan versi tak terpakai (document.cleanup, storage.cleanup).\nEvent doc_created / doc_edited menyimpan referensi → dirakit ulang tiap giliran.\nPembuatan/aktivasi/penghapusan versi hanya lewat facade modul documents.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "document_versions: tiap edit/generate = versi baru.\nSumber: upload · generate_* · edit_document · apply_word_edits · replicate.\nTrigger DB membersihkan versi tak terpakai (document.cleanup, storage.cleanup).\nEvent doc_created / doc_edited menyimpan referensi → dirakit ulang tiap giliran.\nPembuatan/aktivasi/penghapusan versi hanya lewat facade modul documents.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "bff0fb5e7b5147d896a5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 670, "y": 430, "width": 570, "height": 200, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f7dd7a8af85943e99ae7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 281931540, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 892062088, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419173334, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "26dc12cc607442bcbcbe", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 470.4, "width": 290.4, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f7dd7a8af85943e99ae7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1764359491, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1847228604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173334, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "edit_document (tracked changes)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "edit_document (tracked changes)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "251de7a3f2ff4b248936", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 502.1, "width": 404.2, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["f7dd7a8af85943e99ae7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708669414, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1316955204, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173334, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Untuk .docx milik user. Model kirim substitusi minimal:\n{find, replace, context_before, context_after, reason}.\nKonteks ~40 karakter dipakai agar lokasi tak ambigu.\nUI menampilkan kartu Accept/Reject + tautan unduh versi baru.\nHanya bila allowDocumentMutation.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Untuk .docx milik user. Model kirim substitusi minimal:\n{find, replace, context_before, contex